<title>HUNGARY: Hungary '97 Jan-Feb trade gap falls to $431.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary '97 Jan-Feb trade gap falls to $431.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's accumulated a trade deficit of $431.4 million in the 1997 January-February period, down from $450.6 million in the same period of 1996, the Ministry of Industry and Trade (MIT) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    ($million)		Jan-Feb '97	   Jan-Feb '96</p>
<p>    Imports			  2,380.6		 2,287.5</p>
<p>    Exports			  2,812.0		 2,738.1</p>
<p>    Trade deficit		    431.4		   450.6</p>
<p>-- NOTE - MIT data are based on customs statistics.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
